 New user and organization profile pictures use Active Storage. Its URLs take
 precedence when an attachment exists. Otherwise the application uses the same
-CarrierWave URL (or default picture) as before. The schema migration does not
-copy or delete pictures, and other upload types stay on CarrierWave.
+CarrierWave URL (or default picture) as before.
+User and organization profile images no longer mount CarrierWave uploaders.
+A read-only legacy lookup preserves uncopied pictures and allows the copy task
+to be rerun after this deploy. CarrierWave is still used for local image
+validation and processing before new pictures are stored in Active Storage.
+The schema migration does not copy or delete pictures, and other upload
+types stay on CarrierWave.
 
